# hi-lite-golden-v1
# fallback semantic runs for languages without a syntect default grammar

line 1: 0..27=comment
line 2: 0..8=keyword
line 3: 0..5=keyword 5..7=normal 7..18=string
line 4: 0..5=keyword 5..7=normal 7..11=number
line 5: 0..8=keyword 8..10=normal 10..13=type 13..14=normal 14..30=comment
